--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -9,6 +9,18 @@ pnpm install && pnpm run start
 
 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## View preservation
+
+Visited views are retained by the shared layout during client navigation. The cache
+keeps up to six views, reuses their DOM and component state on return, and evicts
+the least recently used view when full. Inactive views are hidden and inert.
+Paths and query strings identify views; hash links share the same view. Astro
+continues to fetch the destination document and manage its head, history, and
+scroll position. A full reload clears the cache. Sign-in and sign-up opt out with
+`cacheView={false}` on `Layout` so their form state is discarded on departure.
+
+Run `pnpm test` for DOM cache tests and `pnpm build` for the production build.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
